# Pause and unpause mid-song (M2RoS bank_000.asm:7471, :7505). The pause
# mutes everything and plays its own sound, eight option sets over $40 ticks
# on the noise channel and square 1, and holds at $10 until the unpause,
# which requests square 1's $1E and runs the song on from where it stopped.
# Requests made while paused are dropped, except the wave channel's, which
# waits for the unpause. Seven seconds.
